# Skills are authored in rocket-agents, nowhere else

Unscoped on purpose: it matters at the first Write of a new `SKILL.md`, before
any path-scoped rule loads, and the superpowers `writing-skills` skill points at
`~/.claude/skills/`, which here deletes the skill.

The only source is `~/p/agents/src/skills/core/<name>/SKILL.md`,
registered in `src/skills/skill-rules.map.json`, then `skills:compile` and
`skills:link`. `~/.claude/skills/`, `~/.agents/` and the rocket-agents-library
checkout are generated output the link wipes: `ui-verification-loop` was
written there on 2026-09-11 and erased that night. Gates: `skill-self-healing`.
